{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/fc3fc74cf52fe88b28c3ababa6ea5385.avif?t=1760900900\" width=614 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supreme Heroes</strong> is an <strong>Action Fantasy RPG</strong>\u00a0inspired by the likes of    <i>Kingdom Hearts 2\u00a0</i>and<i>\u00a0STAR WARS Jedi: Fallen Order,\u00a0</i>and it follows the life of Jacob Matthew Caullen.<i>\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the modern-fantasy metropolis of Some City, California, Jacob suddenly discovers his supernatural powers only weeks away from his sixteenth birthday. It's rare enough to manifest one supernatural ability, let alone three! But Jacob only did so with the help of five immortals known  as &quot;The Select Few&quot;.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having fought in many of Earth's most historic wars, saving and protecting mankind, the aging Select Few now commission Jacob to team up with his four best friends and become &quot;The <i>Elect</i> Few&quot;. But convincing them to embrace their untapped supernatural power, remain united in the face of  worldly tensions, and accept the mantle of saving the world is all but easy. Perilous events force the Elect Few to battle a recurring villain to save the city and together become <strong>Supreme Heroes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/17b970e943e470e8b6c72f7216dc4aa5.avif?t=1760900900\" width=704 height=904 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/6b597617719903ccb5c5c4c5b484ad79.avif?t=1760900900\" width=614 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big part of the <strong>Supreme Heroes</strong> game mechanics is  getting to experience the Sword Fantasy of a Hack-n-Slash ARPG but in a timeline just a few decades ahead of our own, so there's some gunplay to compliment the Swordplay. The catch is...you\u2019re  teens so you only have access to a powerful rubber bullet riot gun, which is classified as an <strong>Enlightened Attack</strong>. Only certain Forms, like Guardian Forms, have access to Enlightened Attacks, but <i>all</i> weapons grant you access to Magic Casting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your\u00a0<strong>Magic Casting</strong> comes\u00a0in three types: Short Spells, Mid Spells, and Long Spells. It all depends\u00a0on what Empyrean Blade you have equipped. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Empyrean Blade comes with an immense array of stats... from swing styles, combos, and stances, to magic casting and defensive abilities...\u00a0 from unique names and histories, to their tremendous enchantment of your armor, allowing you to don a new suit with every new weapon <i>and</i> channel the spirits of the blades' previous wielders on the fly, letting you chain together nigh unstoppable combos against your foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/e6c722445c13469924b6a74681eb6cba.avif?t=1760900900\" width=704 height=960 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/5c17b86dd9edc4e2eecf2e32b8eae438.avif?t=1760900900\" width=614 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover or <strong>Craft</strong> your arsenal and become a <strong>Supreme Hero</strong> as you face off against villains in your city, a city filled with hidden loot and rare Empyrean Blades! Smelting down recovered minerals and then\u00a0crafting<strong>\u00a0</strong>allows you to forge your Empyrean swords, hammer, spears, axes, and daggers so you can access them from your inventory, even during storyline segments where weapon access is normally restricted. You can also trade obtained goods and minerals with vendors to help you craft the Empyrean blade you're looking for!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/39bd18ec28a215137df82e1d86ce9ffd.avif?t=1760900900\" width=704 height=960 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/380da33c89de20ee502e81cf0dac34f3.poster.avif?t=1760900900\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/380da33c89de20ee502e81cf0dac34f3.webm?t=1760900900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/380da33c89de20ee502e81cf0dac34f3.mp4?t=1760900900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/612543f1024029e36bf13bc1e72b7afc.avif?t=1760900900\" width=614 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 ways you can access your arsenal:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With enough Experience,\u00a0<strong>Quick Swap</strong>\u00a0between you and your team's 5 weapons. As you gain more XP, you can eventually <strong>Quick Swap</strong> between 8 devastatingly more powerful and uniquely enchanted weapons!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Stats Menu</strong>\u00a0(after getting your XP to Level 3) shows you all the weapons you can eventually have. Once you find them, they'll be ready for your viewing and selection. The <strong>Stats Menu</strong> lets you preview your new set of armor with each new equip. You can also see that weapon's power level  and a brief description of its stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Hot Bar </strong>method gives you a persistent and customizable menu that lets you move or replace  up to 4 crafted weapons or items right from your inventory however you wish!\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/4953ac834701ec10787923c8f841528e.poster.avif?t=1760900900\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/4953ac834701ec10787923c8f841528e.webm?t=1760900900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/4953ac834701ec10787923c8f841528e.mp4?t=1760900900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/aa1e00bb009eb8db5a24c44727308dc0.poster.avif?t=1760900900\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/aa1e00bb009eb8db5a24c44727308dc0.webm?t=1760900900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/aa1e00bb009eb8db5a24c44727308dc0.mp4?t=1760900900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/23a800b338ca7310b35b2cbd49246754.avif?t=1760900900\" width=704 height=904 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/ab8282ba7a2dd15c73477ade40c73743.avif?t=1760900900\" width=614 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your handy\u00a0<strong>Map, </strong>you can\u00a0<strong>Fast Travel</strong> between discovered landmarks or place markers for taking the scenic route with your trusty Cytron\u00a0<strong>Motorcycle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liberate</strong>\u00a0the fantastical modern metropolis from your foes to level up as soon as you can. Scattered lore and triggered <strong>City Events</strong> will populate your <strong>Help</strong> database with  info about those items and enemies.\u00a0Only then can you unlock more skills and\u00a0<strong>Fly</strong> across rooftops or <strong>Wall-Run</strong>  up skyscrapers, finding more loot for crafting and lurking enemies for XP, ultimately becoming the hero this city deserves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/0c7315a27b22df583f61f84139b9bea7.avif?t=1760900900\" width=576 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/b3d69482d318294fd55fc8f2787300f4.avif?t=1760900900\" width=614 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the way of the Heroes by retrieving and retaining\u00a0<strong>Orbs</strong>, your  source of strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/366480fcff15464e54fd7007a349564a.poster.avif?t=1760900900\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/366480fcff15464e54fd7007a349564a.webm?t=1760900900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/366480fcff15464e54fd7007a349564a.mp4?t=1760900900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbs. Are. Everything! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Be mindful of your <strong>Orb Gauge</strong> <i>(Mana)</i> and <strong>Orb Vitality</strong> <i>(Health)</i>. Should your opponent deal damage to you, you'll lose Orbs from both your Orb Vitality <i>and</i> your Orb Gauge, robbing you of your very essence and your ability to use Magic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also gain or lose Orbs depending on the public's perception of you, in a similar fashion to Karma, so don't go slicing too many light posts and trees in half!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieve dropped Orbs and Orblettes to maintain vitality and, more importantly,  to unlock new <strong>Advances</strong> <i>(Skills)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/b21aff39e10515a6e45660eeecab71e4.poster.avif?t=1760900900\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/b21aff39e10515a6e45660eeecab71e4.webm?t=1760900900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/b21aff39e10515a6e45660eeecab71e4.mp4?t=1760900900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between your arsenal, your crafting, and your abilities, you should be well-equipped for the world of battle that lies ahead, <i>hero</i>...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3431600?t=1760900900","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760900900","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/2d4adf1638a9cd8b5af9f01e50336c686d938632/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760900900","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/2d4adf1638a9cd8b5af9f01e50336c686d938632/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760900900","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Ultra widescreen support.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/fc3fc74cf52fe88b28c3ababa6ea5385.avif?t=1760900900\" width=614 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supreme Heroes</strong> is an <strong>Action Fantasy RPG</strong>\u00a0inspired by the likes of    <i>Kingdom Hearts 2\u00a0</i>and<i>\u00a0STAR WARS Jedi: Fallen Order,\u00a0</i>and it follows the life of Jacob Matthew Caullen.<i>\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the modern-fantasy metropolis of Some City, California, Jacob suddenly discovers his supernatural powers only weeks away from his sixteenth birthday. It's rare enough to manifest one supernatural ability, let alone three! But Jacob only did so with the help of five immortals known  as &quot;The Select Few&quot;.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having fought in many of Earth's most historic wars, saving and protecting mankind, the aging Select Few now commission Jacob to team up with his four best friends and become &quot;The <i>Elect</i> Few&quot;. But convincing them to embrace their untapped supernatural power, remain united in the face of  worldly tensions, and accept the mantle of saving the world is all but easy. Perilous events force the Elect Few to battle a recurring villain to save the city and together become <strong>Supreme Heroes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/17b970e943e470e8b6c72f7216dc4aa5.avif?t=1760900900\" width=704 height=904 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/6b597617719903ccb5c5c4c5b484ad79.avif?t=1760900900\" width=614 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big part of the <strong>Supreme Heroes</strong> game mechanics is  getting to experience the Sword Fantasy of a Hack-n-Slash ARPG but in a timeline just a few decades ahead of our own, so there's some gunplay to compliment the Swordplay. The catch is...you\u2019re  teens so you only have access to a powerful rubber bullet riot gun, which is classified as an <strong>Enlightened Attack</strong>. Only certain Forms, like Guardian Forms, have access to Enlightened Attacks, but <i>all</i> weapons grant you access to Magic Casting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your\u00a0<strong>Magic Casting</strong> comes\u00a0in three types: Short Spells, Mid Spells, and Long Spells. It all depends\u00a0on what Empyrean Blade you have equipped. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Empyrean Blade comes with an immense array of stats... from swing styles, combos, and stances, to magic casting and defensive abilities...\u00a0 from unique names and histories, to their tremendous enchantment of your armor, allowing you to don a new suit with every new weapon <i>and</i> channel the spirits of the blades' previous wielders on the fly, letting you chain together nigh unstoppable combos against your foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/e6c722445c13469924b6a74681eb6cba.avif?t=1760900900\" width=704 height=960 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/5c17b86dd9edc4e2eecf2e32b8eae438.avif?t=1760900900\" width=614 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover or <strong>Craft</strong> your arsenal and become a <strong>Supreme Hero</strong> as you face off against villains in your city, a city filled with hidden loot and rare Empyrean Blades! Smelting down recovered minerals and then\u00a0crafting<strong>\u00a0</strong>allows you to forge your Empyrean swords, hammer, spears, axes, and daggers so you can access them from your inventory, even during storyline segments where weapon access is normally restricted. You can also trade obtained goods and minerals with vendors to help you craft the Empyrean blade you're looking for!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/39bd18ec28a215137df82e1d86ce9ffd.avif?t=1760900900\" width=704 height=960 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/380da33c89de20ee502e81cf0dac34f3.poster.avif?t=1760900900\" width=800 height=450 ><source 